_:b199_b0 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://ref.gs1.org/epcis/EPCISDocument> .
_:b199_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "" .
_:b199_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Architecture: the event references identifiers by URI — GTIN in epcList, GLN in readPoint/bizLocation, party GLN in source/destination. Model-, location-, and party-level master data is served by the GS1 Digital Link / Web Vocabulary resolver when those URIs are dereferenced; it is NOT embedded in the event." .
_:b199_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "GS1 demo prefix 952 (7-digit GCP: 9521234)." .
_:b199_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "HTTP header: GS1-Extensions: oec=https://ref.openepcis.org/extensions/common/core/, euppwr=https://ref.openepcis.org/extensions/eu/ppwr/" .
_:b199_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Material recovery event at an EPR-registered recycler. The TransformationEvent consumes returned PET bottles (class-level GTIN in inputQuantityList — mixed lots, so no AI 10) and produces food-grade rPET flake as a new class-level output; the ilmd declares the output's 100% post-consumer recycled content." .
_:b199_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "masterDataAvailableFor carries ONLY item/lot-level master data (e.g. countryOfOrigin, regulatoryInformation, harvestDate, EUDR plot geolocation). ilmd carries lot/instance data of the items this event creates. Observation extensions sit at event level." .
_:b199_b0 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo> "2.0" .
